0.9 20sep2026
* Migrated to the Windy Stations API v2.  The endpoint used through 0.8 was
  retired in January 2026 and rejects credentials issued after that date.
* Uploads are now a GET with query parameters rather than a POST of JSON.
* New option station_password, which is what windy calls this value.  The
  previous option name api_key is still accepted as a synonym.
* The station option is now required, and is a string rather than an integer.
* Round wind direction to an integer.  Windy rejects fractional values with
  HTTP 400 even though its published schema declares the field a number.
* Send solar radiation when the station reports it.

0.8 04mar2026
* Removed references to distutils. -tk
* Minimum supported version of WeeWX is 4.1.

0.7 08may2020
* Ported to WeeWX V4 logging facility. -tk

0.6 09jan2020
* deal with None for observation readings

0.5 20apr2019
* If debug >= 2, post urls and JSON to the log
* If available, use the weewx v4 log api.
* Ran through PyCharm code inspection

0.4 23apr2019
* station id is necessary only for multiple stations, and is an integer

0.3 18apr2019
* Windy has fixed POSTS, so use them exclusively

0.2 18apr2019
* workaround windy bug - they seem to accept imperial units but not metric

0.1 16apr2019
* initial release
